    "Witches and Druden, their signs and defence; witch animals at particular places (black cat, three-legged hare, three-legged calf, Kühtanz near Gera); fiery dragon; sorcerers with devil books and earth mirrors at Gera, Langenberg, Töppeln, Kraftsdorf and others.",
